        <li><a href="/en/seo-afro-fashion-lifestyle/">Afro fashion &amp; lifestyle</a></li>
        <li><a href="/en/ai-visibility-geo-black-brands/">AI visibility for Black-owned brands</a></li>
        <li><a href="/en/seo-afro-haircare/">Afro &amp; textured haircare SEO</a></li>
        <li><a href="/en/seo-makeup-black-skin/">Makeup for Black skin SEO</a></li>
        <li><a href="/en/seo-woocommerce-black-owned-brands/">WooCommerce / PrestaShop SEO</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cta-band reveal">
      <img width="918" height="832" src="/images/icon-cream.webp" class="icon-watermark" alt="" />
